    private readonly ModelMeshOperations _meshes=new();private readonly DestructionGeometryOperations _geometry=new();private readonly PhysicsGeometryOperations _physicsGeometry=new();private readonly PhysicsCollisionWorldOperations _collision=new();private readonly PhysicsSettingsOperations _settings=new();private readonly ActorAnimationOperations _animation=new();private readonly DestructionAuthoringOperations _authoring=new();private readonly DestructionMaterialOperations _materials=new();private readonly ModelGeometryOperations _modelGeometry=new();private readonly DestructionDefinitionOperations _definition=new();
    private static Settings Map(GodotObject owner,string key)=>owner.Get(key).AsGodotDictionary();private static Variant Get(Settings values,string key,Variant fallback=default)=>values.TryGetValue(key,out var value)?value:fallback;private static Resource Actor(RefCounted controller,string id)=>Map(controller,"prototypes")[id].AsGodotDictionary()["actor"].As<Resource>();private static RefCounted World(RefCounted controller)=>controller.Get("world").As<RefCounted>();private Settings Config(RefCounted controller,string id,double time){var actor=Actor(controller,id);return _settings.sample(actor,controller.Call("_local",actor,time).AsDouble());}private Settings Values(RefCounted controller,string id,double time){var actor=Actor(controller,id);return _animation.sampled_values(actor,controller.Call("_local",actor,time).AsDouble());}
    public void reset(RefCounted owner,bool keepPrepared){foreach(var value in Map(owner,"nodes").Values)foreach(var item in value.AsGodotArray()){var node=item.AsGodotObject() as Node;if(GodotObject.IsInstanceValid(node))node!.Free();}foreach(string key in new[]{"nodes","collider_keys","interiors","sources"})Map(owner,key).Clear();if(!keepPrepared){Map(owner,"cache").Clear();owner.Set("cache_bytes",0);}}
    public Settings source(RefCounted owner,RefCounted controller,string id,Settings state)
    {
        var sources=Map(owner,"sources");if(sources.ContainsKey(id))return sources[id].AsGodotDictionary();var mesh=new KiwiModelMesh();var materials=new Godot.Collections.Array<Material>();var prototype=Map(controller,"prototypes")[id].AsGodotDictionary();var runtime=controller.Call("_runtime",id).AsGodotObject() as Node;if(prototype["geometry"].AsGodotDictionary()["meshes"].AsGodotArray().Count==0&&runtime!=null)prototype["geometry"]=_physicsGeometry.capture(runtime,Map(controller,"prototypes"));var geometry=controller.Call("_simulation_geometry",id,state).AsGodotDictionary();foreach(var value in geometry["meshes"].AsGodotArray()){var item=value.AsGodotDictionary();if(Get(item,"skin").VariantType!=Variant.Type.Nil)return new Settings{["error"]="Topology-changing rigged destruction is not supported yet. Make a static posed copy before cutting; skin weights were preserved on the original."};var polygon=Get(item,"polygon");if(polygon.VariantType==Variant.Type.Object&&ActorDataOperations.ScriptIs(polygon.AsGodotObject() as Resource,"res://Workspaces/ModelWorkspace/model_mesh.gd")){_meshes.append_mesh(mesh,polygon.As<Resource>(),item["local"].AsTransform3D(),materials.Count);foreach(var material in item["materials"].AsGodotArray())materials.Add(material.As<Material>());continue;}var render=new ArrayMesh();foreach(var surface in item["surfaces"].AsGodotArray()){var arrays=surface.AsGodotArray();if(arrays[(int)Mesh.ArrayType.Color].VariantType==Variant.Type.PackedColorArray)foreach(var color in arrays[(int)Mesh.ArrayType.Color].AsColorArray())if(!color.IsEqualApprox(new Color(1,1,1,1)))return new Settings{["error"]="Vertex-colored destruction is not supported by the polygon converter yet. Bake vertex colors to a texture first; the original was preserved."};if(arrays[(int)Mesh.ArrayType.Bones].VariantType!=Variant.Type.Nil&&arrays[(int)Mesh.ArrayType.Bones].AsInt32Array().Length>0)return new Settings{["error"]="Use an unskinned/posed static copy for destructive topology edits."};render.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles,arrays);}_meshes.append_mesh(mesh,_meshes.from_mesh(render),item["local"].AsTransform3D(),materials.Count);foreach(var material in item["materials"].AsGodotArray())materials.Add(material.As<Material>());}int vertices=mesh.Get("vertices").AsVector3Array().Length;if(vertices==0)return new Settings{["error"]="Source geometry is not ready. Retry after the actor has loaded."};if(vertices>20000)return new Settings{["error"]="Source exceeds the 20,000-vertex destruction limit. Simplify or split its components."};var result=new Settings{["error"]="",["mesh"]=mesh,["materials"]=materials};sources[id]=result;return result;
    }
    public void synchronize(RefCounted owner,RefCounted controller,double time){var keep=new Settings();var keys=Map(owner,"collider_keys");foreach(var id in Map(controller,"prototypes").Keys){var state=Map(controller,"states")[id].AsGodotDictionary();foreach(var value in Get(state,"destruction_fragments",new GArray()).AsGodotArray())keep[value.AsGodotDictionary()["id"]]=true;if(state.ContainsKey("destruction_geometry"))sync_actor_world(owner,controller,id.AsString(),state,time);else if(keys.ContainsKey(id)){var config=Config(controller,id.AsString(),time);var shape=_physicsGeometry.collider(Map(controller,"prototypes")[id].AsGodotDictionary()["geometry"].AsGodotDictionary(),config);_collision.remove(World(controller),id.AsString());_collision.add(World(controller),id.AsString(),shape["shape"].As<Shape3D>(),shape["offset"].AsTransform3D(),config["layer"].AsInt32(),config["mask"].AsInt32());_collision.place(World(controller),id.AsString(),state["pose"].AsTransform3D(),config["collision"].AsBool()&&state["active"].AsBool());keys.Remove(id);}}foreach(var key in keys.Keys.ToArray())if(key.AsString().Contains(":fragment:",StringComparison.Ordinal)&&!keep.ContainsKey(key)){_collision.remove(World(controller),key.AsString());keys.Remove(key);}}
    public Settings prepare(RefCounted owner,RefCounted controller,string id,Settings state,Settings values,Settings operations)
    {
        var data=source(owner,controller,id,state);if(data["error"].AsString().Length>0)return data;var seen=new Settings();foreach(var entry in operations){string operationId=entry.Key.AsString();var operation=entry.Value.AsGodotDictionary();foreach(var dependency in Get(operation,"depends_on",new GArray()).AsGodotArray())if(!seen.ContainsKey(dependency))return new Settings{["error"]="Operation "+operationId+" requires an earlier active operation "+dependency.AsString()+". Restore it or adjust the dependency/timing."};if(Get(operation,"enabled",true).AsBool())seen[entry.Key]=true;}int budget=Math.Clamp(Get(values,"debris_budget",96).AsInt32(),2,256);operations=_authoring.geometry_operations(operations);foreach(var value in operations.Values){var operation=value.AsGodotDictionary();if(Get(operation,"type",0).AsInt32() is 1 or 2)operation["pieces"]=Math.Min(Get(operation,"pieces",6).AsInt32(),budget);}var sourceMesh=data["mesh"].As<Resource>();long key=(long)GD.Hash(new GArray{sourceMesh.Get("vertices"),sourceMesh.Get("faces"),sourceMesh.Get("uv"),sourceMesh.Get("materials"),operations,budget});var cache=Map(owner,"cache");if(cache.ContainsKey(key))return cache[key].AsGodotDictionary();ulong started=Godot.Time.GetTicksUsec();var output=_geometry.evaluate(sourceMesh,operations,data["materials"].AsGodotArray().Count);owner.Set("builds",owner.Get("builds").AsInt64()+1);if(output["error"].AsString().Length>0)return output;bool detached=output["detached"].AsBool();var parts=output["parts"].AsGodotArray();if(detached&&parts.Count>budget)return new Settings{["error"]="Fracture exceeds the actor's physical debris budget. Use fewer cuts/pieces or increase the budget; source geometry was preserved."};var rows=new GArray();for(int i=0;i<parts.Count;i++){var mesh=parts[i].As<Resource>();var center=_meshes.bounds(mesh).GetCenter();var local=_meshes.copy_mesh(mesh);var vertices=local.Get("vertices").AsVector3Array();for(int j=0;j<vertices.Length;j++)vertices[j]-=center;local.Set("vertices",vertices);rows.Add(new Settings{["id"]=key+":"+i,["mesh"]=local,["center"]=center,["volume"]=Math.Max(.00001,_geometry.volume(local))});}long bytes=0;foreach(var value in rows){var mesh=value.AsGodotDictionary()["mesh"].As<Resource>();bytes+=mesh.Get("vertices").AsVector3Array().Length*12L;foreach(var face in mesh.Get("faces").AsGodotArray())bytes+=face.AsInt32Array().Length*16L+64;}if(bytes>33554432)return new Settings{["error"]="Prepared destruction exceeds the 32 MiB geometry budget. Lower mesh/fracture resolution."};output=new Settings{["error"]="",["rows"]=rows,["materials"]=data["materials"],["detached"]=detached,["key"]=key,["bytes"]=bytes};long cacheBytes=owner.Get("cache_bytes").AsInt64();while(cache.Count>0&&(cache.Count>=24||cacheBytes+bytes>33554432)){var oldest=cache.Keys.First();cacheBytes-=Get(cache[oldest].AsGodotDictionary(),"bytes",0).AsInt64();cache.Remove(oldest);}owner.Set("cache_bytes",cacheBytes+bytes);cache[key]=output;owner.Set("elapsed_usec",Godot.Time.GetTicksUsec()-started);return output;
    }
    public double mass(RefCounted owner,RefCounted controller,string id,Settings state,Settings values,double fallback){if(!Get(values,"destruction_use_density",false).AsBool())return fallback;var material=_materials.resolve(values,Vector3.Zero);if(material==null)return fallback;var data=source(owner,controller,id,state);if(data["error"].AsString().Length>0)return fallback;return Math.Max(.0001,_geometry.volume(data["mesh"].As<Resource>())*Math.Abs(state["pose"].AsTransform3D().Basis.Determinant())*Get(material.Get("values").AsGodotDictionary(),"density",1000).AsDouble());}
    public void hide(RefCounted owner){foreach(var value in Map(owner,"nodes").Values)foreach(var item in value.AsGodotArray()){var node=item.AsGodotObject() as MeshInstance3D;if(GodotObject.IsInstanceValid(node))node!.Hide();}}
    public void interpolate(Settings result,Settings left,Settings right,double fraction){if(Get(left,"destruction_detached",false).AsBool()!=Get(right,"destruction_detached",false).AsBool()){foreach(string key in new[]{"destruction_geometry","destruction_detached","destruction_fragments"}){if(!left.TryGetValue(key,out var value)){result.Remove(key);continue;}result[key]=value.VariantType==Variant.Type.Array?Variant.From(value.AsGodotArray().Duplicate(true)):value.VariantType==Variant.Type.Dictionary?Variant.From(value.AsGodotDictionary().Duplicate(true)):value;}return;}var a=Get(left,"destruction_fragments",new GArray()).AsGodotArray();var b=Get(right,"destruction_fragments",new GArray()).AsGodotArray();bool same=a.Count==b.Count;if(same)for(int i=0;i<a.Count;i++)if(a[i].AsGodotDictionary()["id"].AsString()!=b[i].AsGodotDictionary()["id"].AsString()){same=false;break;}if(!same){result["destruction_fragments"]=a.Duplicate(true);return;}for(int i=0;i<a.Count;i++)if(a[i].AsGodotDictionary()["id"].AsString()==b[i].AsGodotDictionary()["id"].AsString())result["destruction_fragments"].AsGodotArray()[i].AsGodotDictionary()["pose"]=a[i].AsGodotDictionary()["pose"].AsTransform3D().InterpolateWith(b[i].AsGodotDictionary()["pose"].AsTransform3D(),(float)fraction);}
